{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mature Content Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features explicit sexual scenes, full and partial nudity, and adult language. All characters are twenty-one (21) years or older, and all intimacy is consensual. <br>Non-English text is machine-translated and may include mistakes and misinterpretations.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759910/extras/df31b0ad6578e62cd415d93886e83f87.avif?t=1757078627\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought you had scored the bargain of a lifetime: a cosy basement flat at a price that barely dents your indie-dev salary. One surprise \u201csafety drill\u201d later, the exits seal, the world outside goes silent, and you discover you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759910/extras/4ad1f2e1258dd4eae9338ed8d6e2fecd.avif?t=1757078627\" width=800 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riley\u2014an anxious yet talented femboy designer\u2014has also been locked inside. Now the two of you must share rations, living space, and a terrifying uncertainty about what really happened topside. Will the forced proximity spark friendship, romance\u2026 or heartbreak?<br><br>Manage your days in a light sandbox: cook steamy meals, trade heartfelt gifts, sneak playful peeks \ud83d\ude3c, and build trust one choice at a time. Your decisions branch the story toward multiple endings, from pure fluff to bittersweet tragedy.\u00a0<i>Bunkered with Femboy</i> invites you to unlock Riley\u2019s deepest secrets\u2014or leave him stranded in a crumbling world.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759910/extras/7c51a6033b8859b3a73517b512953b8a.avif?t=1757078627\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative &amp; Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your words and actions steer both lives toward sweet, spicy, or bittersweet finales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Daily Sandbox</strong> \u2013 Choose how to spend limited time: cooking, gifting, exploring tight rooms, or triggering NSFW encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship Progression</strong> \u2013 Earn Riley\u2019s trust to unlock new dialogue, private scenes, and daring options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scene Gallery</strong> \u2013 Replay any unlocked moment whenever you wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles &amp; Easter Eggs</strong> \u2013 Find non-canon art pieces that brighten your bunker walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Language Support</strong> \u2013 \u00a0Enjoy machine-assisted localisations beyond English.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759910?t=1757078627","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759910/f1fd16babe8b86c4d33f911fdf7acac0a3856dc7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757078627","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759910/6a00931d1b2ec460dfc08322f5e6a26673336bc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757078627","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759910/6a00931d1b2ec460dfc08322f5e6a26673336bc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757078627","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79